{"id":"droga","lemma":"droga","pos":"noun","rank":703,"glosses":["drug","indebtedness, debt"],"ipa":"/ˈdɾoɡa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"drogas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f0/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-droga.wav","examples":[{"text":"Es como una droga.","en":"It's like a drug.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442689"},{"text":"No deberías consumir drogas.","en":"You shouldn't do drugs.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460254"},{"text":"El problema de la droga es internacional.","en":"The drug problem is international.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/707762"},{"text":"Es adicto a las drogas.","en":"He's addicted to drugs.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/636922"},{"text":"Dicen que esa droga no es segura.","en":"They say that that drug is not safe.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/687320"}]}